  "title": "[SAZ]SurvivorsAndZombies",
  "description": "Modpack 1st Anniversary Celebration Update",
  "body": "# **简体中文**\n横尸遍野，生灵涂炭！人类已无任何希望！<br/>\n你现在能做的只有保命！<br/>\n跑！逃逸才是对的！<br/>\n注：国内玩家请到[MC百科](https://www.mcmod.cn/modpack/970.html)里进行讨论<br/>\n# **丧尸启示录！**\n\n<details>\n<summary>包含的模组</summary>\n只允许僵尸生成<br/>\n更好的生物群系过度(优化)<br/>\n铷<br/>\nFPS减速器<br/>\n[TaC]永恒枪械工坊<br/>\n村民崛起-警卫村民<br/>\n更多的模组<br/>\n</details>\n\n# **English**\nBodies lie all over the ground, beings are suffering immensely! Humanity has no hope left! <br/>\nWhat you can do now is only to stay alive!<br/>\nRun! Escaping is the right thing to do!<br/>\n# **Zombie Apocalypse!**\n<details>\n<summary>Included Mods</summary>\nThere are no other monsters—Bad Mobs<br/>\noptimize—Better Biome Blend<br/>\nRubidium<br/>\nFPS Reducer<br/>\nTaC Guns<br/>\nGuard Villagers<br/>\nMore Mods ...<br/>\n</details>\n\n[Wiki](https://saz.fandom.com/wiki/SurvivorsAndZombies_Wiki)<br/>\n[Let's take part in the survey ^ U ^.](https://saz.fandom.com/f/p/4400000000000036388)<br/>\n[Discord](https://discord.gg/XsdJc4BuYp)",
